<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n70235" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεό-δμητος</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δαμάω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>newly tamed</i>: metaph., of young wives,
				<i>new-wedded,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρη</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				623
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναῖκες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					3.405
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>newly killed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				887
			</span></i> (lyr., 
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεόκμητον</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				65
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>born of recent defeat,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγκη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Q.S.
					5.161
				</span></i>
			.</div>
